Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.97,0:03:26.69,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Mon cœur devient plus affûté (N’abandonne jamais)
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.69,0:03:35.03,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Au bout de ce destin sans fin
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.03,0:03:38.82,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je fais le serment devant cette océan lumineux
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.49,0:03:41.49,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Que je tiendrai bon
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.49,0:03:43.70,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si je tombe ici
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.70,0:03:49.21,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je lèguerai le sens de la vie
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.26,0:03:56.17,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le ciel s’effondre
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.43,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si le firmament me tombe dessus
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.43,0:04:03.14,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je briserai les desseins d’un dieu fou
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.14,0:04:05.18,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.18,0:04:07.23,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.23,0:04:11.73,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.73,0:04:16.19,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}J’allume une flamme
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.19,0:04:22.37,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}L’étincelle de la vie (Le destin commencera ce soir)
